		0x0002,	 $ Descriptor
		0xC1, 1,	$ Data Type, Data Size
		"Enable Alarm Latch #0",
		"",
		"Alarms will Latch FAULTED until a 'Latch Reset' command is received.  \n\nAlarms effected:  \n - Low & Low Low level Alarms  \n - High & High High level Alarms  \n\nStatus not effected:  \n - Input Status (No Field Power)  \n - Over and Under Range Status  \n\nThis is useful in tracking transient or momentary errors.",
